  "item_short_desc": "<p>Constructed from a rugged 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, our Midnight Camo BDU Shorts are built for unparalleled performance, comfort, and convenience while you are on the field. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, and are perfect for various outdoor activities, such as camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133391",
  "description": "<p>Constructed from a rugged 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, our Midnight Camo BDU Shorts are built for unparalleled performance, comfort, and convenience while you are on the field. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, and are perfect for various outdoor activities, such as camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, and more. Ultimate Stealth Ops Camo: Inspired by stealth operations that require zero visibility to the opposition, Rothco has reinvented the classic Woodland Camouflage Pattern as well as our bestselling Black Camouflage Pattern to bring you the Midnight Camo Collection. The subdued color combinations offer a true stealth, sharp and sleek appearance whether on mission or off. High-Capacity Storage: The camouflage BDU shorts provide functional utility through 2 front slash pockets, 2 large cargo pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for storing everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Comfortable Zipper Fly: These tactical cargo shorts come equipped with a zipper fly for easy on and off, along for a secure fit during outdoor adventures. Perfect Fit: The adjustable waist tabs are designed to give you the perfect, custom fit, every time and anywhere. Upgrade your tactical loadout with these incredible BDU cargo shorts.</p>",
